{"4230380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tinker Islands", "steam_appid": 4230380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230380/extras/4f401b85c878ea32c94fd85f99b47e5b.avif?t=1784639486\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230380/extras_big/4f401b85c878ea32c94fd85f99b47e5b.webp?t=1784639486 width=1560 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tinker Islands</strong> is a multiplayer sandbox set in unique ocean worlds filled with tropical islands for you and your friends to explore. Some islands are abundant in resources; others hide forgotten treasure, dangerous creatures, or places full of mystery. Whether you're sailing solo or with friends, there's always a new island on the horizon worth checking out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the perfect place to settle: From sandy beaches to deep jungles, or towering cliffs - build your own outpost, hideout, or cozy township. Progress by exploring the world, gathering materials, crafting new tools and equipment, and finding powerful blueprints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The journey is its own reward: Set sail, follow your curiosity, and create your own stories along the way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230380/extras/fcf38e2d90966f0838db17b566f29614.avif?t=1784639486\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230380/extras_big/fcf38e2d90966f0838db17b566f29614.webp?t=1784639486 width=1560 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230380/extras/5b1d742897d8c5ce6f8446355d5456fb.avif?t=1784639486\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230380/extras_big/5b1d742897d8c5ce6f8446355d5456fb.webp?t=1784639486 width=1560 height=264 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural map with hand-crafted elements, making every world unique</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail the open seas on your own or with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride the waves in your customizable boat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new and exciting islands in a vast ocean world across diverse biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and build your own outposts, hideouts, and cozy settlements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own weapons and equipment to fit your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight monsters as a swashbuckling fighter, a blunderbuss-wielding hunter, a fireball-throwing mage, or a mix of anything you like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden dungeons filled with loot and dangerous bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your gear to explore new horizon</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Off to the horizon!</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230380/extras/4f401b85c878ea32c94fd85f99b47e5b.avif?t=1784639486\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230380/extras_big/4f401b85c878ea32c94fd85f99b47e5b.webp?t=1784639486 width=1560 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tinker Islands</strong> is a multiplayer sandbox set in unique ocean worlds filled with tropical islands for you and your friends to explore. Some islands are abundant in resources; others hide forgotten treasure, dangerous creatures, or places full of mystery. Whether you're sailing solo or with friends, there's always a new island on the horizon worth checking out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the perfect place to settle: From sandy beaches to deep jungles, or towering cliffs - build your own outpost, hideout, or cozy township. Progress by exploring the world, gathering materials, crafting new tools and equipment, and finding powerful blueprints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The journey is its own reward: Set sail, follow your curiosity, and create your own stories along the way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230380/extras/fcf38e2d90966f0838db17b566f29614.avif?t=1784639486\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230380/extras_big/fcf38e2d90966f0838db17b566f29614.webp?t=1784639486 width=1560 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230380/extras/5b1d742897d8c5ce6f8446355d5456fb.avif?t=1784639486\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230380/extras_big/5b1d742897d8c5ce6f8446355d5456fb.webp?t=1784639486 width=1560 height=264 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural map with hand-crafted elements, making every world unique</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail the open seas on your own or with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride the waves in your customizable boat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new and exciting islands in a vast ocean world across diverse biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and build your own outposts, hideouts, and cozy settlements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own weapons and equipment to fit your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight monsters as a swashbuckling fighter, a blunderbuss-wielding hunter, a fireball-throwing mage, or a mix of anything you like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden dungeons filled with loot and dangerous bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your gear to explore new horizon</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Off to the horizon!</strong></h2>", "short_description": "Gather your friends and sail a vast ocean filled with wonders and danger in this cozy Caribbean sandbox. Discover islands, gather resources, upgrade your gear, make a new home, and see what's waiting over the next horizon.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230380/a7bc3bfb5ec327f472618ca15ad4145a959b4b99/header.jpg?t=1784639486", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230380/669df3338cc6c4fd342c43ec00cbd08b192f9255/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784639486", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230380/669df3338cc6c4fd342c43ec00cbd08b192f9255/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784639486", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10, Windows